<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-THIRD BLANK DAY IN WINDIES-INDIA TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-THIRD BLANK DAY IN WINDIES-INDIA TEST.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHNS, Antigua 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>No play was possible on the third day of the fourth test between West Indies and India on Sunday.</p>
<p>It was the third successive blank day.</p>
</text>
